description:
Ask a non-player to play Fast Facts. 
 Ask the 10 questions and record with consent: 
 What colours are in the Australian flag? (Blue, Red, White); 
 How many stars in the Southern Cross? (5); 
 Which two animals on the Australian coat of arms? (Kangaroo & Emu); 
 What does CD stand for? (Compact Disc); 
 What is the tallest building in Sydney CBD? (Crown Tower / Westpoint Tower); 
 Name two bridges that allow people in/out of Sydney CBD (ANZAC, Harbour); 
 Which has more bones: hands or feet? (Hands); 
 What is the human's largest organ? (Skin); 
 Which one is not like the other: Wallaby, Koala, Joey, Alligator, Jabiru? (Alligator); 
 In which Australian state is the quokka found? (WA).
